sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User/Browser
    participant R as SvelteKit Route
    participant V as Zod Validator
    participant S as Service Layer
    participant SC as Settings Cascade
    participant Sn as Snippet Service
    participant Ex as Execution Service
    participant OC as OpenCode SDK
    participant DB as SQLite

    U->>R: POST /api/prompts/:id/execute
    R->>V: Validate request body
    V-->>R: Validated payload

    R->>S: executePrompt(id, options)
    S->>SC: resolveModel(scope, overrides)
    SC->>DB: Query settings cascade
    SC-->>S: Resolved config (model, temp, tokens)

    S->>Sn: renderSnippets(promptId, values)
    Sn->>DB: Get snippet values
    Sn-->>S: Final prompt text

    S->>Ex: run(resolvedPrompt, config)
    Ex->>OC: createSession(prompt, model)
    OC-->>Ex: Stream response
    Ex-->>S: Execution result + metrics

    par Async logging
        S->>DB: Save executionLog
    end

    S-->>R: Structured result
    R-->>U: JSON response
